ithubusercontent.com/u/10037021?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ideamonster","html_url":"https://github.com/ideamonster","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ideamonster/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ideamonster/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ideamonster/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ideamonster/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ideamonster/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ideamonster/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ideamonster/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ideamonster/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ideamonster/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-22T21:22:26Z","updated_at":"2025-05-22T21:22:26Z","body":"Can confirm that running the game with Legacy runtime 1.0 solves the issue (Right click on game -> Properties -> Compatibility -> Check: Force to use a specific compatibility tool -> Select Legacy runtime 1.0 in dropdown)\nSadly, I cannot set this from the back end, my only option are to select 3.0 Sniper or 1.0 Scout so that means each user has to set this to make it work.\n\nmacOS issue was unrelated and was resolved. Will close this now, thanks for the pointers!","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2902603683/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2902814661","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/106718#issuecomment-2902814661","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106718","id":2902814661,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6tBW_